{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54419","headline":"登润州慈和寺上房 · 崔致远","name":"登润州慈和寺上房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"登临蹔隔路歧尘，吟想兴亡恨益新。\n画角声中朝暮浪，青山影里古今人。\n霜摧玉树花无主，风暖金陵草自春。\n赖有谢家余景在，常叫词客爽精神。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54419.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54419","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}